<title>FINLAND: Finnish PK Cables to be listed April 3 -bourse.</title>
<headline>Finnish PK Cables to be listed April 3 -bourse.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Helsinki Stock Exchange said in a statement on Thursday that the listing of electric wiring and components maker PK Cables Oy would start on April 3.</p>
<p>&quot;PK Cables Oy's share will be traded in the Helsinki Stock Exchange starting from April 3,&quot; the bourse said.</p>
<p>Earlier this week, PK Cables said its offering of 2.6 million shares had been heavily oversubscribed.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, e-mail news@reuters.fi</p>
